@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequence {
  ActorBorderColor #1D4ED8
  ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  ParticipantBorderColor #475569
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E2E8F0
  DatabaseBorderColor #047857
  DatabaseBackgroundColor #D1FAE5
  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
}

title Immutable libmorphism release and public readback

actor Maintainer
participant "Local release gate" as Gate
participant "Exact Git tag" as Tag
participant "GitHub Actions" as CI
database "Checksummed crate" as Crate
participant "GitHub Release" as GitHub
participant "crates.io" as Registry

Maintainer -> Gate: verify-release.sh
activate Gate
Gate -> Gate: Rust + minimum version + proofs + docs + package
Gate --> Maintainer: complete evidence or fail closed
deactivate Gate
Maintainer -> Tag: create exact v{Cargo version} tag
Maintainer -> CI: dispatch validate-only on exact tag
activate CI
CI -> CI: recheck exact tag, lockfile, Rust 1.85, Rocq
CI -> Crate: package and checksum immutable source
CI --> Maintainer: validated artifact identity
deactivate CI

alt Publish GitHub destination
  Maintainer -> CI: dispatch github-release on same tag
  CI -> GitHub: create only when release is absent
  GitHub --> Maintainer: read back tag, assets, checksums
else Publish registry destination
  Maintainer -> CI: dispatch crates-io on same tag
  CI -> Registry: publish only when version is absent
  Registry --> Maintainer: read back version and checksum
end

note over Tag,Registry #FEF3C7
The tag and public version are immutable.
A correction requires a new Cargo version and tag.
end note
@enduml
